- U | watch your own self-tapes back, and find what the casting directors are not seeing | v: achievement, self-direction | tribal: go over every telling you gave in your head, and find what the elders did not see in it | magic: go over every trial you gave, and find what the masters did not see in it | chance: 70
- B | add two credits you never had and stage combat to your CV | v: achievement, power | mark: hid a wrong | closed: approval: false credits and skills on a casting CV; backfire: a casting director checks, or the next job puts the actor in a sword fight | tribal: tell the other bands you played in two great tellings you never saw | magic: add two companies you never played with, and swordplay, to your letter to the brokers | chance: 78
- R | put on your own show in a pub back room every week, rather than wait | v: self-direction, stimulation | self_control: + | tribal: tell a story of your own at the outer fire every few nights, rather than wait to be asked | magic: play a piece of your own in a tavern yard every week, rather than wait for a company | chance: 74
- G | take the old friend's steady job, and let acting go for now | v: security, tradition | self_control: - | drops: professional actor | tribal: go back to the hunt for good, and let the tellings go for now | magic: go back to your old trade for good, and let the playhouse go for now | chance: 85
